==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Dirt Cheap}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore Jr.]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns.
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Elephantidae Papaou]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[R.Ost]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**5 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

